WEBVTT

00:03:27.196 --> 00:03:31.236
but also for delivering on the 17
Sustainable Development Goals.

00:03:31.836 --> 00:03:34.356
Let me give you an example
of what this looks like.

00:03:34.676 --> 00:03:36.116
The Great Green Wall,

00:03:36.116 --> 00:03:40.676
an idea born in Africa over a decade ago
at the edge of the Sahara.

00:03:40.996 --> 00:03:43.196
It aims to stop desertification

00:03:43.236 --> 00:03:46.756
and restore 100 million hectares
of degraded lands

00:03:46.796 --> 00:03:50.556
from Senegal in the West
to Djibouti in the Horn of Africa.

00:03:51.196 --> 00:03:54.916
It's an ambitious plan
to plant 100 million trees,

00:03:54.956 --> 00:03:58.316
improve water harvesting
and the use of land.

00:03:58.316 --> 00:04:01.436
Clearly, the climate benefits
will be enormous,